{
  "operation": "gdrive.find_by_name",
  "origin": "example",
  "note": "Hand-written from the Google Drive API v3 reference for files.list (GET /drive/v3/files with a q parameter), whose body carries a files array of File resources plus a nextPageToken when more pages exist. Two matches for a name search: a Google Sheets file, and a shortcut, which the File resource reference documents as carrying no size. The pagination token and the top-level kind are what the client ignores, so an accidental strict decoder would fail here. Not a recording.",
